      "signature": "\u2200 {n : \u2115} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n \u2192 \u211d} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) {r p : \u2115} (k : \u2115)\n  (U : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) \u211d),\n  U.transpose * U = 1 \u2192\n    \u2200 (L : \u211d),\n      (\u2200 (k : \u2115), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (U.transpose.mulVec (R.gradientChange k)) \u2264 L * R.curvature k) \u2192\n        \u2200 (V W Z : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin p) \u211d) (T : BfgsVerification.Mat p) (b : BfgsVerification.Vec p)\n          (m C\u2080 C_T C_R : \u211d),\n          0 \u2264 C_T \u2192\n            m \u2264 BfgsVerification.sqNorm (V.transpose.mulVec (R.g k)) \u2192\n              BfgsVerification.sqNorm (W.transpose.mulVec (R.gradientChange k)) \u2264 C\u2080 * R.curvature k \u2192\n                W = V * T + BfgsVerification.EnergyIdentities.rectOuter (R.displacement k) b + Z \u2192\n                  BfgsVerification.FrameBounds.OperatorSqBound T (1 + C_T * R.d k) \u2192\n                    U * U.transpose * Z = Z \u2192\n                      BfgsVerification.SmoothSubspace.frobSq Z \u2264 C_R * R.d k \u2192\n                        (BfgsVerification.metricGram (R.hessian (k + 1)) W).trace \u2264\n                          (1 + R.d k) * (1 + C_T * R.d k) *\n                                ((BfgsVerification.metricGram (R.hessian k) V).trace - m / R.q k) +\n                              (1 + (R.d k)\u207b\u00b9) *\n                                (C_R * R.d k * ((BfgsVerification.metricGram (R.hessian 0) U).trace + L * \u2191k)) +\n                            C\u2080",
