    {
      "theorem": "BfgsVerification.normalizedHierarchy_of_principalMinorHierarchy",
      "signature": "BfgsVerification.PrincipalMinorHierarchyTarget \u2192\n  \u2200 {n : \u2115} (R : BfgsVerification.FullBFGSRun n) (G c : \u211d),\n    0 < G \u2192\n      0 < c \u2192\n        (\u2200 (k : \u2115), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (R.g k) \u2264 G ^ 2) \u2192\n          (\u2200 (k : \u2115), c \u2264 R.beta k) \u2192\n            BfgsVerification.ScalarHierarchy.NormalizedHierarchy n (fun k => BfgsVerification.principalSum (R.H k)) R.q\n              (fun k => R.d k / c) (4 * G ^ 2 / c ^ 2) (G ^ 2)",
