      "signature": "\u2200 {n : \u2115} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n \u2192 \u211d} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (G \u2113 : \u211d),\n  0 < G \u2192\n    (\u2200 (k : \u2115), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (R.g k) \u2264 G ^ 2) \u2192\n      Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds \u2113) \u2192\n        Summable R.d \u2227\n          Filter.Tendsto (BfgsVerification.reciprocalGeometricMean R.q) Filter.atTop Filter.atTop \u2227\n            Filter.Tendsto (BfgsVerification.reciprocalMean R.q) Filter.atTop Filter.atTop \u2227\n              Filter.Tendsto (fun N => (\u2211 k \u2208 Finset.range N, (R.q k)\u207b\u00b9) / \u2191N ^ 2) Filter.atTop Filter.atTop",
